        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I'm sure it doesn't happen very often, but last night we happened to be playing against Citizen Dawn who by the second turn had the card out that has her take 2 damage and put the top card of the deck into play at the end of her turn.  Later on, she got duplicate of that card out (not happy, since it's not limited).  So, she rather ran through her deck quite quickly.\n\nNow, as it turned out, we defeated her on the turn she used the last cards from her deck, but...\n\nWhat happens when a villain's deck runs out of cards?  Do you reshuffle the discard pile?  Or are they out of cards?",
